# Kubernetes 1.28.15 images for the kubeadm path.
#
# The control-plane images are deliberately not listed here. build-offline-bundle.sh
# asks kubeadm itself — "kubeadm config images list", with the image repository the
# installer uses — because a hand-written list goes stale the moment a patch release
# moves a tag: 1.28.15 wants etcd 3.5.15-0, and naming 3.5.9-0 here is what made an
# offline install try to pull from a registry it cannot reach.
#
# What is left is the CNI, which kubeadm knows nothing about. These are the upstream
# calico images rather than a re-hosted copy: the project's own kubecube/calico-*:vX-m
# tags exist for the versions it has repackaged, and 1.28 is not one of them. The
# manifest that goes with this file (cni/calico/v1.28.15/calico.yaml) has to name the
# same images, which the builder checks and refuses to build if they disagree.

docker.io/calico/node:v3.26.4
docker.io/calico/cni:v3.26.4
docker.io/calico/kube-controllers:v3.26.4
